#. BobbyModding.MaterialSearchOverlay.MaterialSearchOverlayStrings.UI.OVERLAYS.MATERIALSEARCH.DESCRIPTION
msgctxt "BobbyModding.MaterialSearchOverlay.MaterialSearchOverlayStrings.UI.OVERLAYS.MATERIALSEARCH.DESCRIPTION"
msgid "Search by name to find anything in your colony and highlight it on the map.\nNames can be partial and ignore case: 'hatch' finds Hatches, 'iron' finds Iron Ore.\nSearchable kinds:\n- Materials, e.g. Iron Ore, Bleach Stone\n- Plants and food, e.g. Mealwood, Mirth Leaf, Raw Egg\n- Equipment and boosters, e.g. Atmo Suit, Advanced Medical Booster\n- Industrial products, e.g. Microchip, Atomic Power Bank\n- Critters and duplicants, e.g. Hatches, Pufts, Duplicant\n- Artifacts, e.g. Nuclear Power Plant Model"
msgstr ""

